    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\n`vim.text.diff()` only returns line diffs and does not support the `inline:XXX` variants from `diffopt`.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n`vim.text.diff()` should either extend the `indices` result type or provide a new one that returns character ranges within each line.",
